              "handle": "boat-tote-keychain",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>A favorite shape, made small. The Boat Tote Keychain carries the familiar contrast trim and belted front of a tote into a playful everyday keepsake. Add it to your keys or a bag for a little character that travels with you.</p>"
