    {
      "handle": "bag-organizer",
      "data": {
        "data": {
          "productUpdate": {
            "product": {
              "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7652325949505",
              "handle": "bag-organizer",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>A calmer beginning to a busy day. The Bag Organizer gives the small things a place of their own, from the keys you need first to the essentials you like close by. Its soft, structured felt brings order to a favorite tote without changing what you love about it.</p>"
            },
            "userErrors": []
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "handle": "velantra-boat-tote-2",
      "data": {
        "data": {
          "productUpdate": {
            "product": {
              "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7694299856961",
              "handle": "velantra-boat-tote-2",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Camille is made for a day that takes the scenic route. Sturdy canvas, contrasting trim and a familiar boat-tote silhouette feel at home at the market, by the water or beside your desk. Easy to dress around and full of character, it is the bag that becomes part of your routine.</p>"
            },
            "userErrors": []
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "handle": "velantra-weekender",
      "data": {
        "data": {
          "productUpdate": {
            "product": {
              "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7971794747457",
              "handle": "velantra-weekender",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>For the Friday departure and the invitation that becomes a weekend away. The Eleanor has the presence of a travel bag with the considered details of a favorite handbag: rolled handles, a broad leather flap and a generous silhouette. It feels as natural beside a wool coat as it does at the end of a sunlit platform.</p>"
            },
            "userErrors": []
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "handle": "the-colette-wool-tote",
      "data": {
        "data": {
          "productUpdate": {
            "product": {
              "id": "gid://shopify/Product/7995691106369",
              "handle": "the-colette-wool-tote",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Colette belongs to crisp mornings, long lunches and the coat you return to every autumn. A softly structured brushed-wool body meets smooth leather at the handles and belted front, with warm gold details catching the light. Tactile and quietly expressive, it brings a little softness to a full day.</p>"
            },
            "userErrors": []
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
