        "data": {
          "productUpdate": {
            "product": {
              "id": "gid://shopify/Product/8053052178497",
              "handle": "velantra-juliette",
              "descriptionHtml": "<p>A bookshop afternoon, a soft knit, plans left open. The Juliette brings suede and smooth leather together in a generous, gently slouching shape. Short rolled handles, loose front ties and warm brass-tone accents give it a thoughtful informality, for the woman who makes an ordinary day her own.</p>"
